<title>FINLAND: Finnish Dec PPI falls 1.8 pct yr/yr -SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish Dec PPI falls 1.8 pct yr/yr -SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index rose 0.1 percent in December on November, and it fell 1.8 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>			   Nov 1996    Nov 1996	Dec 1995</p>
<p>   Mth/Mth	     +0.1 pct    -0.2 pct	+0.2 pct</p>
<p>   Yr/Yr		 -1.8 pct    -1.8 pct	+3.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 6805 0245</p>
